---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="A Spark specialist on Microsoft's Azure Data CAT team, sharing personal insights from working with customers.">
  <article class="article">
    <div class="shell">
      <header class="article__head">
        <h1 class="article__title">About</h1>
      </header>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I work at Microsoft on the Azure Data CAT team as a Spark specialist.
          Previously, my work at Microsoft focused on building data platforms for clients.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site brings together my past and current experience working with customers.
          It is a place to explore the technical details of that work — from Spark tuning
          and Delta Lake to building data platforms on Microsoft Fabric.
        </p>
        <p>
          Posts reflect my own experience and views. They are not official Microsoft
          communications, recommendations or best practices.
        </p>
        <h2>Reuse</h2>
        <p>
          Posts are mine; code samples are yours to use. If a post also appears on
          LinkedIn or the Fabric Community blog, this copy is the original.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
